OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThursday will start fine with
OL,6,Fsome pleasant spells of sunshine
OL,7,Fduring the morning. Cloud slowly
OL,8,Fincreasing from the west though into
OL,9,Fthe early afternoon, with rain
OL,10,Farriving later on in the day. Becoming
OL,11,Fbreezy too.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowery rain at first this
OL,14,Fevening will clear away to the east,
OL,15,Fleaving a mix of clear spells and the
OL,16,Fodd shower overnight. A milder night
OL,17,Fthan the previous night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,169,160,301,260,100,100
